wo turn blue litmus paper red?",["NaOH and KOH","HCl and HNO₃","HCl and NaOH","HNO₃ and KOH"],"B",3,1,"6ab2846d1612"],["A gas that turns moist red litmus blue is:",["alkaline","acidic","neutral","a noble gas"],"A",5,0,"8618923d472b"],["Sulphuric acid is used on a large scale in the manufacture of:",["fertilizers","glass only","table salt","sugar"],"A",3,0,"a15bac98cd8e"],["The hydrogen-ion concentration of a solution is 1 × 10⁻² mol/dm³. Its pH is:",["−2","3","2","12"],"C",3,0,"gen-chemistry-c10-ph"],["The hydrogen-ion concentration of a solution is 1 × 10⁻⁸ mol/dm³. Its pH is:",["6","9","−8","8"],"D",3,0,"gen-chemistry-c10-ph"],["The hydrogen-ion concentration of a solution is 1 × 10⁻³ mol/dm³. Its pH is:",["−3","3","11","4"],"B",3,0,"gen-chemistry-c10-ph"],["The hydrogen-ion concentration of a solution is 1 × 10⁻¹⁰ mol/dm³. Its pH is:",["11","10","4","−10"],"B",3,0,"gen-chemistry-c10-ph"],["The hydrogen-ion concentration of a solution is 1 × 10⁻⁵ mol/dm³. Its pH is:",["5","−5","9","6"],"A",3,0,"gen-chemistry-c10-ph"],["The hydrogen-ion concentration of a solution is 1 × 10⁻⁴ mol/dm³. Its pH is:",["10","4","5","−4"],"B",3,0,"gen-chemistry-c10-ph"],["The pH of a solution is 12. Its pOH is:",["26","2","5","12"],"B",3,0,"gen-chemistry-c10-poh"],["The pH of a solution is 5. Its pOH is:",["2","5","9","19"],"C",3,0,"gen-chemistry-c10-poh"],["The pH of a solution is 4. Its pOH is:",["18","3","10","4"],"C",3,0,"gen-chemistry-c10-poh"],["The pH of a solution is 11. Its pOH is:",["11","25","4","3"],"D",3,0,"gen-chemistry-c10-poh"],["The pH of a solution is 2. Its pOH is:",["2","16","5","12"],"D",3,0,"gen-chemistry-c10-poh"],["The pH of a solution is 10. Its pOH is:",["10","24","3","4"],"D",3,0,"gen-chemistry-c10-poh"],["How many moles of NaOH are needed to neutralise 1 mol of HCl completely?",["2 mol","1 mol","0.5 mol","4 mol"],"B",5,1,"gen-chemistry-c10-neutralisation"],["How many moles of NaOH are needed to neutralise 1.5 mol of HNO₃ completely?",["1.5 mol","3 mol","0.75 m